<title>USA: Fed's Phillips repeats need to lift bank firewalls.</title>
<headline>Fed's Phillips repeats need to lift bank firewalls.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Reserve Governor Susan Phillips on Thursday reiterated the central bank's proposal to lift most restrictions imposed on bank holding companies involved in securities underwriting and dealing.</p>
<p>Phillips told a Senate Banking subcommittee that the so-called &quot;firewalls&quot; between banking and securities have served &quot;an important role,&quot; but added: &quot;If financial modernization is to move forward, the issue of firewalls will have to be confronted.&quot;</p>
</text>
